Third-party attributions
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

This project's self-evolving research component ("Tau-RSI") adapts the method
described in:

  Dream-RSI: Recursive Self-Improvement through Evolving Worlds
  Tong Zheng et al. (Google, University of Maryland), 2026.
  arXiv:2609.14858 — https://github.com/zhengkid/Dream-RSI

Tau-RSI reimplements the Dream-RSI loop (online exploration -> replay
simulator -> dreaming-based policy improvement) for binary-options trading
research; it is an independent adaptation of the published method, not a fork
of the original code. If any code is incorporated from that repository,
consult and comply with its upstream license.

Portions of the research-agent design were influenced by open research-agent
workflows (e.g. karpathy/autoresearch). Where upstream code is reused, its
copyright and license are reproduced alongside it.
